trash-compactor.wav is cut from "Trash Compactor" by gmarchisio,
https://freesound.org/people/gmarchisio/sounds/168252/

Released under Creative Commons 0 (CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Changes: taken from Freesound's high-quality MP3 preview, mixed to mono, resampled to 16 kHz, high-passed
at 30 Hz, normalized to -3 dB, and shortened from 38.6 s to 2 s (26.75 to 28.75 s, faded in and out).
